Does anybody owns an original HP Tru64 UNIX 5.1B-3 media+doc kit?
Reading the following quote from HP site makes me think they finally 
integrated patch-kit and NHD on a single installation CD.
Up to 5.1B-2 the OS install CD was always the one from original 5.1B, 
and they just added one CD with with PK4 and another with NHD7+PK4, and 
updated associated products CDs.
Separate CDs cause longer and much more complicated installations and 
upgrades, especially when you have hardware which needs NHD7.
So any one can confirm the single CD?
Greetings

